(44, 48, 'Devo pagare per scarica video da tiktok senza filigrana?', 'No, il tiktok video download è completamente gratuito! Supportiamo tutti i browser moderni come Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, Safari, Microsoft Edge e così via.'),
(45, 48, 'Posso scaricare video senza installare software?', 'Sì, il nostro tiktok downloader funziona con qualsiasi browser e non richiede installazioni. Incollalo nel campo di input e seleziona il formato appropriato per la conversione.'),
(48, 41, 'How to Download a video Tiktok with no watermark?', 'You need to visit thousands of users\' trusted websites, TikTok, enter your  TT video link in the search bar and click the download button to get free of watermarks.'),
(50, 41, 'How to get the TikTok video download link?', 'While scrolling Tiktok, please stay on the video that you like the most and copy its URL by clicking on the bottom right corner.'),
(51, 41, 'Can I download TikTok photos or slideshows?', 'Definitely. TikTokio supports photo slideshows as well. Copy the slideshow link, paste it into the downloader, and save the images in high quality.'),
(52, 50, 'Téléchargeur de vidéos TikTok', 'Téléchargeur de vidéos TikTok'),
(53, 50, 'Téléchargeur de vidéos TikTok', 'Téléchargeur de vidéos TikTok'),
