(138, 41, 'Terms', 'terms-of-use', 'Terms of Use', 'TikTokio provides a free online tool to download TikTok videos and convert them to MP3. We do not charge any fee, and no registration is required.', 'Terms & Conditions', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Welcome to <strong>TikTokio</strong>. By accessing or using our website, you agree to the following terms and conditions. Please read them carefully before using our service.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1. Free Online Service</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>TikTokio provides a <strong>free TikTok video and MP3 downloader</strong>. You do not need to create an account, provide personal information, or install any software. All tools are available online and can be accessed directly from your browser.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2. Independent Platform</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>TikTokio is <strong>not affiliated with TikTok, Douyin, or ByteDance</strong> in any way. We are an independent platform created to provide a convenient service for users who wish to save TikTok content for personal use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3. User Responsibility</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Users are fully responsible for how they use the downloaded videos or MP3 files.</li>\r\n	<li>TikTokio&nbsp;should only be used for <strong>personal and non-commercial purposes</strong>.</li>\r\n	<li>We do not allow or encourage the misuse of any copyrighted material. It is your responsibility to respect the intellectual property rights of content creators.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>4. Copyright &amp; Content Removal</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are a copyright owner and believe that any content on TikTokio violates your rights, you can contact us directly. We will review your request and remove the content if necessary.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5. Limitation of Liability</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>TikTokio&nbsp;does not guarantee that the service will always be available, error-free, or uninterrupted.</li>\r\n	<li>We are not responsible for any damage, loss, or legal issues caused by how users utilize our service.</li>\r\n	<li>By using this website, you agree that you are solely responsible for your actions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>6. Changes to Terms</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We may update these Terms &amp; Conditions from time to time without prior notice. Users are encouraged to review this page regularly for any updates.</p>', '2025-09-01 08:15:11', '2025-10-23 20:09:16'),
(139, 41, 'Privacy', 'privacy-policy', 'Privacy Policy', 'We do not ask users to sign up, create an account, or provide any personal data to use our service.', 'Privacy Policy', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Your privacy is very important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle user information when you use our service.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1. No Registration Required</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>TikTokio is a <strong>completely free service</strong>. We do not require you to sign up, create an account, or provide any personal details to use our tools.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2. Data Collection</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>We <strong>do not collect, store, or share any personal data</strong> of our users.</li>\r\n	<li>When you paste a TikTok link to download, it is processed temporarily to generate the file, and then it is immediately deleted from our system.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>3. Cookies and Third-Party Ads</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>TikTokio&nbsp;itself does not use cookies for tracking users.</li>\r\n	<li>However, third-party advertisers such as <strong>Google AdSense</strong> may use cookies to display personalized ads. These cookies are managed by Google and can be controlled through your browser settings.</li>\r\n	<li>Users may choose to disable cookies if they prefer, but some ad features may not work as intended.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>4. External Links</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our website may contain links to third-party sites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices, security, or content of those external websites.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5. Security of Data</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Since we do not store user data, there is no risk of personal information leakage from our platform. Still, we recommend users to stay cautious when browsing the internet and clicking on ads or external links.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6. Children&rsquo;s Privacy</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>TikTokio is intended for general users. We do not knowingly collect data from children under the age of 13. Parents are advised to supervise children when using online services.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7. Updates to Privacy Policy</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We may update this Privacy Policy when needed. Any changes will be posted on this page, and users are encouraged to review it from time to time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Contact Us</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have any questions, copyright concerns, or privacy issues, you can contact us through the <strong>Contact Page</strong> available on TikTokio. We aim to respond as quickly as possible.</p>', '2025-09-01 08:15:16', '2025-10-23 20:09:08'),
